        "content": "## 26 · AI Churn Prediction\nDaily scores every account for churn risk from usage and support signals and alerts CS on high-risk accounts.\n\n**Trigger:** schedule `0 6 * * *`\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate."
